{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Specifies a modifier to indicate if this Scene can be used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when creating a new Scene for the received External Event.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"conditions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This modifier is only supported for WindowGroup Scene types."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For DocumentGroups, the received External Event must have a URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the DocumentGroup to be considered. (Either via openURL, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the webPageURL property of an NSUserActivity). The UTI for the URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is implicitly matched against the DocumentGroup’s supported types."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to true, an instance of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Scene will be used."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to false, on macOS the Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will not be used even if no other Scenes are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is considered an error. On iOS, the first Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified in the body property for the App will be used."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If no modifier is set, the Scene will be used if all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other WindowGroups with a modifier evaluate to false.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text